<Layout title="About" description="A few words about this site and its author.">
  <p>I am Ashwin, a writer of fiction.</p>

  <p>My stories live at the intersection of magical realism, hard science fiction, and speculative fiction. I am drawn to worlds where the impossible feels inevitable with a single quiet decision capable of bending reality, or where the cold equations of physics quietly reveal something deeply human.</p>

  <p>For many years I have been quietly filling notebooks and empty spaces with ideas. This site is simply a place to let them breathe in public.</p>

  <p>Nothing more, nothing less.</p>
</Layout>
